    {
      "ja": "• 両腕が背中まで届き、ヒートショーテルを背中から抜くアクションが可能。",
      "en": "• Both arms reach up to his back, allowing him to pull out the Heat Shotel from his back."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ヒートショーテルを斜めに構えられる手首パーツが付属。",
      "en": "• Includes wrist parts that allow you to hold the Heat Shotel diagonally."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ヒートショーテルは納刀時、抜刀時の状態をパーツの差し替えにより再現可能！",
      "en": "• Heat Shotel's state when sheathing and unsheathing can be reproduced by replacing parts!"
